> Tip: the full table of every alert and every role is docs/alerts/matrix.md in the code.

## Alerts by email

Staff and Admin alerts that are not urgent no longer come one email each: they come together in one email at most once an hour, with everything since the last one. Urgent ones still come on their own, at most 3 an hour: a payment declined, documents to review for a pickup within 2 hours, and the site down. Every alert is in the bell and on your phone at once either way. Choose under **Settings** > **My profile**, Notifications: alerts by email, **Change how often**: Hourly digest, Daily digest (07:00) or Off.

## One alert per booking moment (release 35)
- A car not back gets one alert per booking and return time, for example "CC-10077 not back: due 5:00 pm, renter reminded, return check-in not started", with **Call** and **Open**. It goes to the Admins, the person on the return job and Fleet, each once.
- What we send the renter about a booking is in the booking''s activity, not an alert of its own.
- The renter''s overdue reminders wait 15 minutes after the return time (Program settings, late chase grace) and stop once staff press **Returning now**, the return job starts, or the tracker shows the car at our location.
- Alerts held by your quiet hours arrive as one summary when they end, grouped by kind, newest first; each stays in the list with its own link.
